{"qid": "tt_t2_00004", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 48.56, "n_tokens": 227, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.56, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 341, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "您查到的《合同法》第五十八条内容本身是准确的，但需要说明的是：**《合同法》已于2021年1月1日随《民法典》施行而废止**，其内容被《民法典》吸收并作了调整。\n\n对应现行有效的规定是**《民法典》第一百五十七条**：\n\n> 民事法律行为无效、被撤销或者确定不发生效力后，行为人因该行为取得的财产，应当予以返还；不能返还或者没有必要返还的，应当折价补偿。有过错的一方应当赔偿对方由此所受到的损失；各方都有过错的，应当各自承担相应的责任。法律另有规定的，依照其规定。\n\n两者核心规则一致（返还财产、折价补偿、过错赔偿），主要区别在于：\n\n1. **适用范围表述不同**：《合同法》第58条针对\"合同无效或被撤销\"；《民法典》第157条针对\"民事法律行为无效、被撤销或确定不发生效力\"，", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.047, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_58", "score": 0.8849, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 58, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_157", "score": 0.5575, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 157, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_563", "score": 0.3228, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 563, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_584", "score": 0.2591, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 584, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_52", "score": 0.2508, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 52, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_587", "score": 0.2271, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 587, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_510", "score": 0.2232, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "art