{"qid": "tt_t2_00010", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 54.24, "n_tokens": 227, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.64, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 341, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "结论：你查到的这条规则本身没有“写错”，但它对应的**2018年修正《公司法》第二十六条**在现行法下已被**2023年修订、自2024年7月1日起施行的《中华人民共和国公司法》**相关条文取代。就你引用的这句话而言，现行法仍保留“有限责任公司注册资本为在公司登记机关登记的全体股东认缴的出资额”这一基本表述，但**新增了“全体股东认缴的出资额由股东按照公司章程的规定自公司成立之日起五年内缴足”的限制**。\n\n具体说：\n\n1. **旧法（2018修正）第二十六条**只规定注册资本为登记机关登记的全体股东认缴的出资额，原则上不设统一实缴期限。\n2. **现行《公司法》第四十七条**规定：有限责任公司的注册资本为在公司登记机关登记的全体股东认缴的出资额；全体股东认缴的出资额由股东", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.053, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_公司法(2018修正)_2018修正_26", "score": 0.8944, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法(2018修正)", "article": 26, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_47", "score": 0.5283, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 47, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_49", "score": 0.2976, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 49, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_51", "score": 0.2281, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 51, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_88", "score": 0.2204, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 88, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_53", "score": 0.1852, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 53, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪02民终1495号_0", "score": 0.1825, "type": "judgment", "law": nul