{"qid": "tt_t2_00016", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 48.54, "n_tokens": 222, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.44, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 333, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "您查到的《合同法》第一百九十六条内容本身是准确的，但该法已经失效，被《民法典》取代。\n\n**一、条文内容对比**\n\n- 《合同法》第一百九十六条：借款合同是借款人向贷款人借款，到期返还借款并支付利息的合同。\n- 《民法典》第六百六十七条：借款合同是借款人向贷款人借款，到期返还借款并支付利息的合同。\n\n两条内容完全一致，属于原条文被《民法典》整体吸收。\n\n**二、效力问题**\n\n《合同法》已于2021年1月1日《民法典》施行时废止（《民法典》第一千二百六十条明确列明废止《合同法》）。因此，2021年1月1日之后发生的借款合同纠纷，应适用《民法典》第六百六十七条，而非《合同法》第一百九十六条。\n\n**三、关于\"律师说法不一样\"**\n\n如果律师讲的是\"《合同法》已", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.047, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_196", "score": 0.8705, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 196, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_667", "score": 0.5874, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 667, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_674", "score": 0.2557, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 674, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初493号_1", "score": 0.1051, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初493号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）浙01民初902号_1", "score": 0.1051, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）浙01民初902号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）津02民再1968号_1", "score": 0.1051, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）津02民再1968号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）津02民初2221号