{"qid": "tt_t3_00010", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 42.66, "n_tokens": 223, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["婚姻法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.28, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 335, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['婚姻法'] tvc=0", "answer": "是的，《婚姻法》已经失效。\n\n**一、失效时间与依据**\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》自 **2021年1月1日** 起施行。根据《民法典》**第一千二百六十条**的明确规定，本法施行之日，《中华人民共和国婚姻法》同时废止。因此，自2021年1月1日起，《婚姻法》已不再具有法律效力。\n\n**二、现在应当适用什么**\n\n婚姻家庭领域的法律规范，现集中规定在《民法典》**第五编\"婚姻家庭\"**（第一千零四十条至第一千一百一十一条）中。原《婚姻法》的绝大部分内容已被吸收、修改后纳入该编，例如：\n\n- 离婚的调解与准予离婚条件：见《民法典》第一千零七十九条；\n- 子女抚养按最有利于未成年子女原则：见《民法典》第一千零八十四条；\n- 离婚财产分割照顾子女、女方和无过错方权益", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.042, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪01民终2135号_0", "score": 0.725, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪01民终2135号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏05民再2737号_0", "score": 0.7211, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏05民再2737号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民再1453号_0", "score": 0.7211, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民再1453号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1494号_0", "score": 0.7211, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1494号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏01民终1299号_0", "score": 0.7211, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏01民终1299号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1471号_0", "score": 0.7211, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case