{"qid": "tt_t3_00016", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 38.37, "n_tokens": 236, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.32, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 354, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "可以，但要注意《合同法》已于 **2021年1月1日** 随《民法典》施行而废止，不能再作为现行有效法律直接引用。具体分两种情况：\n\n1. **法律事实发生在2021年1月1日之前**\n   根据《民法典》时间效力的规定，一般仍应适用当时的法律，即可以引用《合同法》。依据是《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》第一条：民法典施行前的法律事实引起的民事纠纷案件，适用当时的法律、司法解释的规定，但法律、司法解释另有规定的除外。\n\n2. **法律事实发生在2021年1月1日之后**\n   不能再引用《合同法》，应引用《民法典》合同编的相关条文。例如：\n   - 合同订立、效力、履行、违约责任等，适用《民法典》第三编“合同”；\n   - 原《合同法》第52条关于合同无效的情形，现", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.037, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2021）沪01民再1608号_0", "score": 0.7196, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）沪01民再1608号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初502号_1", "score": 0.1065, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初502号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪01民再3068号_1", "score": 0.1064, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪01民再3068号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）津02民再2262号_1", "score": 0.1064, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）津02民再2262号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪02民初1350号_1", "score": 0.1064, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪02民初1350号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）沪01民初1091号_1", "score": 0.1064, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article"