{"qid": "tt_t3_00022", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 36.2, "n_tokens": 232, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["侵权责任法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.28, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 349, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['侵权责任法'] tvc=0", "answer": "是的，《侵权责任法》已经失效。\n\n《中华人民共和国侵权责任法》自2010年7月1日起施行，已于2021年1月1日《中华人民共和国民法典》施行之日起废止（依据《民法典》第一千二百六十条，该条明确列举了包括《侵权责任法》在内的九部法律同时废止）。\n\n**写起诉状时的注意事项：**\n\n1. **侵权行为发生在2021年1月1日之前的**：根据《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》第一条，一般仍应适用当时的法律即《侵权责任法》，此时可以在起诉状中援引《侵权责任法》相关条文。\n\n2. **侵权行为发生在2021年1月1日之后的**：应援引《民法典》侵权责任编的相关条文（第七编\"侵权责任\"，第一千一百六十四条至第一千二百五十八条）。\n\n3. **跨期情形**：需结合上述时间", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.035, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民初443号_1", "score": 0.08, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民初443号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民再413号_1", "score": 0.08, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民再413号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏05民再2737号_1", "score": 0.08, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏05民再2737号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民终1511号_1", "score": 0.08, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民终1511号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民再2148号_1", "score": 0.08, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民再2148号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）川01民终1939号_1", "score": 0.08, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）川01民终1939号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1471号_1", "score": 0.08, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1471号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）鲁01民初1973号_1", "score": 0.08, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）鲁01民初1973号"}]}}}
{"qid": "tt_t3_00028", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 40.5, "n_tokens": 228, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["继承法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.36, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 343, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['继承法'] tvc=0", "answer": "简短回答：**不能继续引用《继承法》**——该法已被废止。\n\n**依据：**\n- 《中华人民共和国民法典》自 **2021年1月1日** 起施行。\n- 同时，《中华人民共和国民法典》**第一千二百六十条**明确规定：本法自2021年1月1日起施行；**《中华人民共和国继承法》……同时废止**。\n\n**实务要点：**\n1. **2021年1月1日之后**发生的继承事实、以及此后审理的案件，应适用**《民法典》第六编\"继承\"**（第1119条至第1163条），不能再以《继承法》作为裁判依据。\n2. **2021年1月1日之前**发生的继承事实，依《民法典》**第一千二百六十条**及《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》，一般仍适用当时的《继承法》——即\"", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.039, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初518号_1", "score": 0.1, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初518号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初502号_1", "score": 0.1, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初502号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪02民再686号_1", "score": 0.1, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪02民再686号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）津02民再332号_1", "score": 0.1, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）津02民再332号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）津02民终1111号_1", "score": 0.1, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）津02民终1111号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民初319号_1", "score": 0.1, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民初319号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）津02民初294号_1", "score": 0.1, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）津02民初294号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）津02民再343号_1", "score": 0.1, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）津02民再343号"}]}}}
{"qid": "tt_t4_00004", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 50.01, "n_tokens": 238, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.7058823529411765, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 358, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=溯及力判断 as_of=2018-02-14 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "**结论：原则上适用行为发生时的旧法（《合同法》等），而非《民法典》。**\n\n**依据：**\n\n1. **《民法典时间效力规定》第三条**（即《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》第三条）规定：民法典施行前的法律事实引起的民事纠纷案件，**当时的法律、司法解释有规定的，适用当时的法律、司法解释**；只有在当时法律、司法解释**没有规定**而民法典有规定时，才可以适用民法典，且明显减损当事人合法权益、增加义务或背离合理预期的除外。\n\n2. 你方行为发生在 **2018-02-14**，属于民法典施行（2021-01-01）前的法律事实。因此：\n   - 若《合同法》等旧法对该纠纷**已有规定** → 适用**当时的旧法**；\n   - 若旧法**没有规定**、而《民法典》有规定 →", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.049, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民终2384号_0", "score": 0.6933, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民终2384号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪01民初1902号_0", "score": 0.684, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪01民初1902号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_3", "score": 0.6787, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 3, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_10", "score": 0.5069, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 10, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民事诉讼法_2023修正_122", "score": 0.4624, "type": "provision", "law": "民事诉讼法", "article": 122, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京01民再2989号_1", "score": 0.4037, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京01民再298